//! Adjusts the both endpoints of row gap decoration segments. Positive lengths shorten segments
//! inward; negative lengths extend them outward.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - overlap-join: Extends intersecting segments to meet across the gap junction; uses zero inset at
